      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "cb12a62bc19c4f1c6a017498aa622fb930c81983b1a279f568214605e340cd95",
      "text": "After breakfast, you meet your English-speaking guide and travel to Hacienda Venecia.\n\nYour introduction to coffee production starts with a cup of the estate’s own coffee. At the plantation, you learn about the origins and history of coffee, as well as the varieties and quality of Colombian coffee. You see how the coffee is grown, harvested, cleaned and sorted before further processing, and you can take part. This hands-on visit connects your everyday cup of coffee with the plantation and the people who grow and prepare the beans.\n\nAfter the tour, you have a traditional Colombian lunch. A workshop on different brewing methods follows, where you can explore how they bring out the coffee’s flavour and aroma. At the end of the programme, you transfer back to the hotel to rest.",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-cbfe38b96910",
        "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
      }
    },
